      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7489,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "原初之龍創造了三月女神與三輪月亮，並將她們升起至天上。在",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9095,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "期間，尼伯龍根囚禁了月神們，並將月亮改造成了武器。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7625,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "艾莉亞是恆月女神——三輪月亮中最大的月亮。正是因她龐大的月矩力，大海才有了潮汐。\n月髓\n蘊含著艾莉亞力量的「恆月」碎片。詠月使",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8396,
        "name": "菈烏瑪",
        "desc": "被月光與森林祝福的聖女，一個誕生在「霜月之子」中的希望。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/09/08/b06e9ff48d57de4856f1a05b1199aae1_8565150401481594895.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "保留著「恆月」的月髓。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9339,
        "name": "桑娜妲",
        "desc": "<p>虹月女神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/19/368338997/5a4d15060c70ece8ddc97b8dc2ff28c8_1143187201626326072.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9340,
        "name": "卡儂",
        "desc": "<p>霜月女神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/19/368338997/10eaa7c4b2eecf195b650c43e85b2587_3143933073634048374.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "艾莉亞是卡儂和桑娜妲的姐姐。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7476,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "新的月神。艾莉亞、桑娜妲、卡儂將她們的權能賦予她，使她成為了「三月女神」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7106,
        "name": "愚人眾",
        "desc": "<p>一個效忠於冰之女皇的至冬組織，其勢力遍布整個大陸。該組織的執行官們正在追尋「神之心」。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/27/368338997/159454dca0123d1c63a52568b03a0a26_8998728010362045421.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "愚人眾正在研究「恆月」的遺骸。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
